## 3. Goals & Non-Goals

### Goals (MVP)
1. Let a landlord list a room or apartment in under 5 minutes.
2. Let a tenant find a relevant room or apartment in under 3 searches.
3. Establish a baseline trust layer (verified contact info) so both sides feel safe enough to talk.
4. Prove landlords will pay to list once trial value is demonstrated.
5. Let tenants filter by property type (room vs. apartment) as a first-class search criterion, not an afterthought.

### Non-Goals (explicitly deferred post-MVP)
- In-app payments / rent collection
- Digital lease signing
- Background checks / credit checks
- In-app real-time chat (start with reveal-contact-info, not a chat engine)
- Multi-country/multi-currency support
- Native iOS app (start web + Android, or responsive web only)

