## 9. Trust & Safety (MVP-appropriate, not over-built)

- Phone + email OTP verification for both landlords and tenants (table stakes)
- Manual admin review queue for new listings in the first months (cheap trust signal while volume is low)
- "Report listing" button on every listing page (essential from day 1)
- Clear photo requirement (min 3 photos) — reduces fake/scraped listings
- Verified badge on profiles once OTP + (optional) ID upload complete
- Reviews/ratings: defer to post-launch once you have real transaction volume to review

**Open question:** Will you require government ID upload for landlords at launch, or only phone/email? ID verification adds friction but meaningfully reduces fraud — recommend deferring ID checks until you see fraud rate in pilot data.

