## 10. Success Metrics (Track from Day 1)

| Metric | What it tells you |
|---|---|
| # Listings created / week (split by room vs. apartment) | Landlord acquisition working, and which property type is driving supply |
| # Active listings (not expired/filled) | Supply health |
| # Searches per tenant session | Search/filter usability |
| # Contact-reveal actions / listing view | Listing quality + match rate — this is your north star metric |
| % Landlords converting free → paid | Monetization viability |
| Time-to-first-contact (listing creation → first contact) | Marketplace liquidity |
| Listing → confirmed move-in rate (self-reported survey initially) | True product-market fit signal, since you won't track this in-app at MVP |

