## 13. Risks & Assumptions

| Risk | Mitigation |
|---|---|
| Chicken-and-egg (no tenants without landlords, vice versa) | Manually onboard landlords first in pilot area; seed supply before promoting to tenants |
| Fake/scam listings damage trust early | Manual review queue + report button from day 1 |
| Landlords resist paying after free trial | Test trial length and price point with small cohorts before wide rollout; watch conversion metric closely |
| Low tenant conversion at "contact reveal" login gate | A/B test allowing partial contact (e.g., WhatsApp click) with lighter-weight verification |

